1
00:00:01,668 --> 00:00:03,668
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

2
00:00:05,769 --> 00:00:07,239
(Skype ringing)

3
00:00:07,237 --> 00:00:08,537
(Amy(on Skype):)Hi, Sheldon.

4
00:00:08,539 --> 00:00:09,539
(Sheldon:)Hello.

5
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:11,340
(Amy:)Are you feeling any better?

6
00:00:11,342 --> 00:00:13,512
(Sheldon:)Physically, yes, but I'm upset

7
00:00:13,511 --> 00:00:17,081
(Sheldon:)because everyone's mad at me
for no good reason.

8
00:00:17,949 --> 00:00:20,119
(Amy:)Why don't you tell me
what happened,

9
00:00:20,117 --> 00:00:21,947
(Amy:)and in a gentle, loving way,

10
00:00:21,953 --> 00:00:25,023
(Amy:)I'll explain to you
why you're wrong.

11
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:27,520
(Sheldon:)You know how, when you're sick,

12
00:00:27,525 --> 00:00:30,625
(Sheldon:)you're allowed to be cranky
and say whatever you want

13
00:00:30,628 --> 00:00:33,628
(Sheldon:)and other people's feelings
don't matter?

14
00:00:34,665 --> 00:00:38,605
(Amy:)Ooh. Gentle and loving...
this is gonna be tricky.

15
00:00:38,603 --> 00:00:40,533
I had a 101 fever.

16
00:00:40,538 --> 00:00:44,878
(Sheldon:)If that's not a time to verbally
abuse my loved ones, when is?

17
00:00:44,875 --> 00:00:50,315
(Amy:)Sheldon, when you're sick,
you can be... unbearable.

18
00:00:50,314 --> 00:00:52,544
(Amy:)That's why your friends
have been known

19
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:56,290
(Amy:)to work late
or sneak out to the movies

20
00:00:56,287 --> 00:00:58,887
(Amy:)or stay at
a neurobiology conference

21
00:00:58,889 --> 00:01:01,489
(Amy:)three days after it's ended.

